    Note over BA,CM: —— 阶段二B：解耦 3 步（T07 的硬前置，§0.5.1）——
    BA->>Bash: 实测 engineering 对 learning/include 的真实依赖
    BA-->>BA: ds/trie.h 两边都有✅ / distributed_index.h+persistent_ds.h 已被 CMake 排除✅
    BA-->>BA: 唯一真实依赖 = uthash（engine/third_part/uthash/src 已存在，diff 仅版本号）
    BA->>Write: ① db/api/CMakeLists.txt:7 find_path HINTS → vendor/third_part/uthash/src
    BA->>Write: ② algo-prod/CMakeLists.txt:16 删 ../learning/include（死 include）
    BA->>Write: ③ storage/graph/:19 + test/db/graph/:25 修不存在的 uthash 路径
    BA->>CM: cmake -B build/engineering -S engine && cmake --build
    BA->>Bash: grep -rn 'learning/include' engine/ --include=CMakeLists.txt → 0 命中 ✅
    BA->>Bash: grep UTHASH_INCLUDE_DIR build/engineering/CMakeCache.txt → vendor/third_part/uthash/src ✅
    Note over BA: ★ 此后 engine/ 对 learning/ 依赖归零，T07 才被解锁
    BA->>Write: 删 cmake/dual-track-guard.cmake（解耦后守卫无意义）
    BA->>CM: cmake -B build/engineering -S engine -DBUILD_TESTING=ON
    alt find_path 找不到 uthash
        CM-->>BA: FATAL_ERROR → 说明跨轨 include 未修全
    else 正常
        CM-->>BA: 配置成功
    end
    BA->>CT: ctest --test-dir build/engineering
    CT-->>BA: 通过
